  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p><strong>About Évoque Mode</strong></p><p>Évoque Mode is a curated luxury fashion destination bringing together established and contemporary designer names across handbags, shoes, ready-to-wear and accessories. Our point of view is rooted in modern femininity, minimalist style and considered dressing — with a focus on pieces that evoke presence rather than follow noise.</p><p><strong>What makes us different</strong></p><p>We offer a highly curated approach to luxury, supported by a trusted European sourcing network and a retail model built around considered pricing. Our evolving selection includes new-season arrivals, investment bags, wardrobe essentials and editorial edits designed to make luxury discovery more intentional.</p><p><strong>How affiliates earn</strong></p><p>Affiliates earn <strong>12% commission on eligible referred orders</strong>, with a <strong>30-day tracking window</strong>. Selected affiliates can also offer their audience an exclusive <strong>10% discount code</strong>, creating a strong incentive for conversion across a luxury product assortment.</p><p><strong>How to promote Évoque Mode</strong></p><p>Create content naturally aligned with your audience and personal style — from designer bag edits and minimalist wardrobes to styling inspiration, seasonal selections, new arrivals and investment pieces. Affiliates receive a personal tracking link and coupon code to share through social content, editorial features, blogs and other approved channels.</p><p><strong>Our ideal partners</strong></p><p>We welcome fashion creators, stylists, editors and publishers whose audiences are interested in luxury fashion, designer accessories, minimalist style and modern femininity. We value thoughtful content, authentic recommendations and long-term affiliate relationships.</p></div></div>",
